stateDiagram-v2
  direction RL
  state "On disk only" as onDisk
  state "Open in a tab, unsaved changes" as unsaved
  state "Open in a tab, saved" as saved
  [*] --> onDisk
  onDisk --> onDisk : get_file_text reads the disk
  onDisk --> onDisk : open_file, no such file (error)
  onDisk --> onDisk : save_files, not open (error)
  onDisk --> saved : open_file, at a line if given
  saved --> saved : get_file_text reads the disk
  saved --> saved : save_files, nothing to save
  saved --> unsaved : the user edits
  unsaved --> unsaved : get_file_text reads the buffer
  unsaved --> unsaved : save_files fails (error)
  unsaved --> saved : save_files
  saved --> onDisk : the user closes the tab

